      "f4": "<strong>Bundle summaries</strong> — multi-entity consolidated payment",
      "body": "All these documents carry the <strong>public verification QR</strong> and can be presented as proof before any administration or third party. See the <a href=\"57-verificar.html\">Verify a receipt</a> page.",
      "fig1": {
        "alt": "Generated tab",
        "caption": "«Generated» tab with sub-tabs (All / Certificates / Receipts / Summaries / Certifications). Grid of «Payment receipt» and «Request summary» cards with dates (April 23, 2026) and references (#REC-2026-..., #PAS-2026-...)."
      }
